title: A new month
subtitle: Regarding the class-ds performance last month.
tags: event
view-if: month = 5 and year = 2000
priority: 1
max-visits: 1

The current class-ds have been quite problematic during testing, and is putting our personnels at risk of failing testing and/or dying.

Since their term is now over, we have the choice to release the class-ds that have been causing problems to our personnels.

- @release: Release the problematic class-ds.
- @eradicate: Kill the problematic class-ds.
- @no: We're going to need the most hands that we can right now.

@no
subtitle: Our personnels may not like this...

@release
subtitle: -1 resources
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
choose-if: resources >= 1
on-arrival: class_d -= 2; class_d_strength -= 0.07; class_d_riot -= 0.1

@eradicate
subtitle: The ethics committee will be displeased.
on-arrival: class_d -= 2; class_d_riot += 0.4; class_d_strength += 0.1; ethics_committee_relation -= 40
